{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1279884-cupid-s-arrow","id":1279884,"title":"Cupid's Arrow","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-10T05:01:03-08:00","id":1279884,"title":"Cupid's Arrow","content":"<span style=\"color:#363636\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Is Cupid's Arrow able to change someone's sexual orientation or at the very least make them lust after someone of the same sex? </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","name":"princeofcincinnati","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-10T06:07:00-08:00","id":1279888,"title":"","content":"Attraction to a specific person does not an orientation make. But yes, you should be able to make someone lust after someone who falls outside their sexual orientation. Just remember that the target of Cupid's Arrow is under no obligation to actually act on those feelings, and in the case of romantic or sexual attraction would likely hesitate due to the confusion and possible guilt stemming from such a rapid change in feelings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http: